{"sources":[{"messageId":"bSJrxBjV8V-3ISp7HgixI","revision":1,"role":"user","text":"裴修远把信封留在灯下，没有拆开，也没有离开邮局。“先核对旧邮戳的样式。你见过这样的窗格标记吗？”"},{"messageId":"XUWYgtixwPScRVSaa0zNS","revision":1,"role":"assistant","text":"裴修远将放大镜移向信封背面。\n\n“见过。旧灯塔的灯室窗格是六格，雾港旧邮戳上也刻过这个图案；后来灯塔改用圆形玻璃，早期的灯塔戳便停用了。”\n\n他从柜下取出一本泛黄的《雾港邮政志》，翻到附录。纸页上印着两个旧戳：一个圆环内是灯塔，另一个圆环内是六格窗。\n\n“不过，窗格标记不是灯塔专属。”裴修远指向另一栏，“北岬邮路经过的望潮亭，也有同样的六格窗。旧邮局发行过一套‘潮线邮戳’，两处共用图案。”\n\n沈知夏俯身看了看，又望向信封上的水渍。\n\n“那枚模糊的‘雾’字，会不会原本是‘北’？”\n\n“有可能。”裴修远说，“但刮痕太重，不能据此认定它来自望潮亭。信是从灯塔直接送来的，还是经过北岬邮路转寄，眼下还分不清。”\n\n他将《邮政志》摊在灯下。\n\n“接下来可以查旧戳的编号备案。守灯人或许知道得更细，但他每晚会去码头买报——我们不必现在去灯塔。”"}],"sourceIdentity":{"floorId":"FQrIPFHeky6hgMfo1QK6h","branchId":"main","runId":"3nvLfuJxPR4tg_yt5wA1M","attemptNo":1,"floorRunId":"3nvLfuJxPR4tg_yt5wA1M","floorAttemptNo":1,"outputPageId":"fbIXvoM1h7LZOwVTE0dbt","assistantMessageId":"XUWYgtixwPScRVSaa0zNS","messages":[{"messageId":"bSJrxBjV8V-3ISp7HgixI","pageId":"wWRkzSHpXIyXWP6TtEzhL","revision":1,"seq":0,"role":"user"},{"messageId":"XUWYgtixwPScRVSaa0zNS","pageId":"fbIXvoM1h7LZOwVTE0dbt","revision":1,"seq":0,"role":"assistant"}]},"toolEvidence":[],"worldbookSelection":{"entries":[{"uid":110,"activationKey":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1:entry:110","source":{"kind":"session_worldbook","worldbookId":"ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH","worldbookName":"雾港地理","assetScopeId":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1"},"insertion":{"position":"before"}},{"uid":120,"activationKey":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1:entry:120","source":{"kind":"session_worldbook","worldbookId":"ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH","worldbookName":"雾港地理","assetScopeId":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1"},"insertion":{"position":"before"}},{"uid":110,"activationKey":"worldbook:7h4CugxkQzHiLLZUB5xV8:1:entry:110","source":{"kind":"session_worldbook","worldbookId":"7h4CugxkQzHiLLZUB5xV8","worldbookName":"雾港人物","assetScopeId":"worldbook:7h4CugxkQzHiLLZUB5xV8:1"},"insertion":{"position":"before"}}],"entryUids":[110,120,110],"presetId":"SN2SnJb0HFd5V3xaC9kM1","presetVersionId":"Ig7rgP