{"sources":[{"messageId":"jbmD4gK6Cxn7Dt3p8l_4v","revision":1,"role":"user","text":"【给写作者的要求】保持第三人称叙述；只写沈知夏的动作和台词，不替裴修远发言或作决定。\n【用户角色的动作与台词】裴修远收好仍未拆开的信，带着沈知夏走出邮局，抵达码头卖报摊前。“到了。你认识守灯人，能请你看看他今晚来了吗？”"},{"messageId":"QClYkf_lLRYBdKBrh98eN","revision":1,"role":"assistant","text":"沈知夏走到报摊前，目光在摊面和通往防波堤的小路上各停了一瞬。\n\n“老板，守灯人今晚来过吗？”\n\n卖报人看了看旧灯塔的方向，摇了摇头，又指向摊位上仅剩的一份《雾港夜报》。\n\n“还没来？”沈知夏轻声问。\n\n卖报人点头。他平日留给守灯人的那份报纸已经被人取走，只剩今晚这一份。\n\n沈知夏望向浓雾里的石阶。潮线已经淹过最低几级，石面泛着冷光。\n\n“按他每晚的习惯，应该已经到了买报的时候。”她退回裴修远身旁，“但石阶正在涨潮。如果他回灯塔，途中可能会被困在半路。”\n\n她压低声音：“也可能是他来过，却刻意避开了报摊。老板只认得常来买报的人，未必留意过守灯人今晚有没有从别处经过。”\n\n沈知夏重新看向报摊。\n\n“老板，刚才还有别人来过吗？尤其是从北岬方向来的人。”"}],"sourceIdentity":{"floorId":"1527Vd_QVWsd2l3Q81LOy","branchId":"main","runId":"rd8OcFS6a-4WR87AU07ju","attemptNo":1,"floorRunId":"rd8OcFS6a-4WR87AU07ju","floorAttemptNo":1,"outputPageId":"5uxX1oxuGL1HFCpddJiU5","assistantMessageId":"QClYkf_lLRYBdKBrh98eN","messages":[{"messageId":"jbmD4gK6Cxn7Dt3p8l_4v","pageId":"kslc4iJPV85Vwjw5E03T5","revision":1,"seq":0,"role":"user"},{"messageId":"QClYkf_lLRYBdKBrh98eN","pageId":"5uxX1oxuGL1HFCpddJiU5","revision":1,"seq":0,"role":"assistant"}]},"toolEvidence":[],"worldbookSelection":{"entries":[{"uid":110,"activationKey":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1:entry:110","source":{"kind":"session_worldbook","worldbookId":"ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH","worldbookName":"雾港地理","assetScopeId":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1"},"insertion":{"position":"before"}},{"uid":120,"activationKey":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1:entry:120","source":{"kind":"session_worldbook","worldbookId":"ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH","worldbookName":"雾港地理","assetScopeId":"worldbook:ULbylNyt2DE2csluZu3cH:1"},"insertion":{"position":"before"}},{"uid":110,"activationKey":"worldbook:7h4CugxkQzHiLLZUB5xV8:1:entry:110","source":{"kind":"session_worldbook","worldbookId":"7h4CugxkQzHiLLZUB5xV8","worldbookName":"雾港人物","assetScopeId":"worldbook:7h4CugxkQzHiLLZUB5xV8:1"},"insertion":{"position":"before"}}],"entryUids":[110,120,110],"presetId":"SN2SnJb0HFd5V3xaC9kM1","p